{"id": "3223995", "revid": "119536", "url": "https://ro.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=3223995", "title": "Madrid Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu feminin", "text": "Madrid Open 2025 \u2013 Dublu feminin a avut loc \u00een a doua jum\u0103tate a lunii aprilie 2025. Treizeci \u0219i dou\u0103 de perechi de juc\u0103toare s-au \u00eenscris \u00een competi\u021bia de dublu a turneului de tenis de la Madrid, Spania, pe terenuri cu zgur\u0103, \u00een exterior. Cristina Buc\u0219a \u0219i Sara Sorribes Tormo au fost campioanele \u00een exerci\u021biu, dar Sorribes Tormo a ales s\u0103 nu participe \u00een acest an, dup\u0103 ce a anun\u021bat c\u0103 ia o pauz\u0103 nedeterminat\u0103 de la tenisul profesionist. Buc\u0219a a f\u0103cut pereche cu Shuko Aoyama, dar perechea a pierdut \u00een fa\u021ba Anna Danilina \u0219i Irina Khromacheva \u00een prima rund\u0103.\nSorana C\u00eerstea \u0219i Anna Kalinskaia au c\u00e2\u0219tigat titlul la dublu feminin la Mutua Madrid Open 2025, \u00eenving\u00e2ndu-le pe Veronika Kudermetova \u0219i Elise Mertens \u00een final\u0103, cu 6\u20137(10\u201312), 6\u20132, [12\u201310]."}
